OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses call for help with
OL,4,A'impossible' fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and charities in the South
OL,7,Fhave said the rising cost of fuel has
OL,8,Fleft them fighting for survival and are
OL,9,Fcalling on the Chancellor for help.
OL,11,FEarlier this month, the RAC said diesel
OL,12,Fprices in the UK had reached an
OL,13,Fall-time high, with the cost of petrol
OL,14,Falso rising.
OL,16,FPeople the BBC spoke to in Hampshire
OL,17,Fand Dorset said they were facing "tough
OL,18,Fchoices" and urged John Healey to cut
OL,19,Ffuel duty in his first Budget on
OL,20,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
