OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses call for help with
OL,4,A'impossible' fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Treasury spokesperson said the
OL,7,FChancellor was "giving the high street
OL,8,Fmore breathing space" by cutting
OL,9,Fbusiness rates and limiting bill
OL,10,Fincreases.
